Not included
------------
Ante, Claude Code, Codex CLI, Hermes, Pi and nanocode are configured by the adapters and used unmodified at pinned
versions; none of their code is included. Pages under swarm/front-maze/, and the bundle report written by
swarm/src/swarm/report.py, load IBM Plex and Space Grotesk from Google Fonts at runtime; no copies are bundled.
The hub console (hub/hub/static/index.html) also loads Space Grotesk and IBM Plex Mono from Google Fonts at
runtime; no copies are bundled. site/live/ uses system font stacks only.
